#N canvas 60 60 900 720 12;
#X text 20 10 glitch_master: inlets = wet L \, wet R \, raw L \, raw R. Chain: overdrive (gain into hard clip) -> master lowpass -> mix crossfade (engine vs raw) -> bypass crossfade (raw wins at 1). All gains 20ms smoothed.;
